<tm:xmi/EAID_3BCBDCCC_067A_4cc7_A2D0_AD6511F6D146> a tm:Class ;
    rdfs:label "BLOCK" ;
    skos:definition "The work of a vehicle from the time it leaves a PARKING POINT after parking until its next return to park at a PARKING POINT. Any subsequent departure from a PARKING POINT after parking marks the start of a new BLOCK. The period of a BLOCK has to be covered by DUTies. Notes: Description of BLOCK. Notes: End time of BLOCK in principle this can be derived from the Start time of the last journey and the finishing duration. . Notes: Day offset of end time from start time Notes: How long needed to prepare to complete BLOCK. Notes: Identifier of BLOCK. Notes: Name of BLOCK. Notes: How long needed to prepare to run BLOCK. Notes: Start time of BLOCK in principle this can be derived from the Start time of the first journey and the preparation duration. . Notes: Day offset of start time from OPERATING DAY." ;
    tm:attribute <tm:xmi/EAID_3BCBDCCC_067A_4cc7_A2D0_AD6511F6D146/attribute/EAID_12062029_A749_4c74_B527_E37196571D5A>,
