<tm:xmi/EAID_7893F04A_C213_4a37_B670_E7A15A996883> a tm:Class ;
    rdfs:label "LEVEL" ;
    skos:definition "An identified storey (ground, first, basement, mezzanine, etc) within an interchange building or SITE on which SITE COMPONENTs reside. A PATH LINK may connect components on different levels. Notes: Whether all areas of component are accessible in a Wheelchair. Notes: Further descriptive note about LEVEL Notes: Identifier of LEVEL. Notes: Name of LEVEL. Notes: Name of a nearby landmark which can be used to refer to SITE Notes: Short Name of LEVEL." ;
