    rdfs:subClassOf <tm:xmi/EAID_3ED87F20_DFA3_49d9_9857_1896A8EEA317> ;
    skos:definition "Optimisation criteria to be used to when computing and decorating trip plans. Notes: Whether the trip calculation should find a solution that starts immediately (eg: because the user is already on the way) instead of finding the latest possible start opportunity. Notes: Whether Accessibility details are to be included. Notes: Whether results should include information about fares. Notes: Whether results should include information about intermediate CALLs that the journey makes between the trip start and end. Notes: Whether results should include information about the origin and destination of a vehicle journey if it starts before the SCHEDULED STOP POINT at which the passenger boards or ends beyond the SCHEDULED STOP POINT at which the passenger alights. Notes: Whether results should include a plot of the legs. Notes: Whether the results should include information about the days on which a service operates. Notes: Whether results should include a plot of the trip. Notes: Whether results should include information about SITUATIONS affecting trip. Notes: Whether step by step turn descriptions are to be provided. Notes: Maximum number of journeys to include in results. Notes: How to optimize the query. Notes: Whether plan should use real-time data if available and if relevant." ;
    tm:attribute <tm:xmi/EAID_FD9EB724_60AF_4297_8C84_672A3B25AC75/attribute/EAID_0D91E73C_FDC2_4e9b_8B71_C99893BABF2A>,
