    rdfs:subClassOf <tm:xmi/EAID_C69D4420_55CB_4f8a_B2C7_41CA50159F90> ;
    skos:definition "The social profile of a passenger, based on age group, education, profession, social status, sex etc., often used for allowing discounts: 18-40 years old, graduates, drivers, unemployed, women, etc. Notes: Age group required by USER PROFILE. Arbitrary category. Notes: Gender required by USER PROFILE. Relevant for single sex accommodation products. Notes: Identifier of USER PROFILE. Notes: Whether User must be local resident. This is a general categorization. A more specific definition can be provided by RESIDENTIAL QUALIFICATION. Notes: Maximum age for membership of USER PROFILE. Notes: Maximum height for membership of USER PROFILE. This may be relevant for judging large dogs Notes: Minimum age for membership of USER PROFILE. Notes: Minimum height for membership of USER PROFILE. Notes: Day / Month on which age applies. if any." ;
    tm:attribute <tm:xmi/EAID_BCDE8D63_837B_4006_906E_903D7E1C0912/attribute/EAID_1D908FBE_9ABB_4657_A9C9_4E514D3E91D2>,
