    rdfs:label "INTERCHANGE" ;
    skos:definition "The scheduled possibility for transfer of passengers at the same or different SCHEDULED STOP POINTs. Notes: Whether INTERCHANGE is controlled. Notes: Whether INTERCHANGE is advertised as guaranteed. Notes: Whether INTERCHANGE involves crossing a national border. Notes: Description of INTERCHANGE. Notes: Maximum wait time a vehicle may wait for a connecting vehicle beyond the planned departure time. Notes: Whether INTERCHANGE is guaranteed, that is distributor services may be held in order to ensure the connection. Notes: Identifier of INTERCHANGE. Notes: Name of INTERCHANGE. Notes: Whether INTERCHANGE is planned. Notes: Priority assigned to INTERCHANGE. Notes: Whether passengers can stay seated to make INTERCHANGE. Notes: Modes by which transfer at the interchange can be made." ;
