    skos:definition "Price features for a PRICEABLE OBJECT. Notes: Price in a specified currency. Notes: Discount given, if any, in a specified currency. Notes: Discount percentage used, if any when deriving price. Notes: End date for PRICE validity. Notes: Identifier of FARE PRICE. Notes: Whether the FARE PRICE is allowed. Default is true. Notes: Name of PRICE. Notes: Relative ranking to be given to discount to use to favour it over other discounts available. Notes: Start date for PRICE validity. Notes: Tax included in Amount, in same currency as amount. Notes: Tax rate used, if any when deriving price." ;
    tm:attribute <tm:xmi/EAID_E0A05D1E_C849_4b64_BE7B_5F9EE33D7F21/attribute/EAID_0217F5D0_F21A_4f83_82E8_16B12B9BC1AC>,
