    rdfs:label "TYPE OF VALUE" ;
    skos:definition "An ENTITY that serves to classify another entry, using as a list of simple code values, each with a name. Notes: Description of TYPE OF VALUE. Notes: Identifier of TYPE OF VALUE. Notes: Name of TYPE OF VALUE." ;
